## Applicability and evolution

The index and baseline rules use `alwaysApply: true`. Topic rules use
`alwaysApply: false` with a description to identify their relevance. These are
integration hints, not permission to disregard applicable rules. Root AGENTS.md
requires agents to read and follow them explicitly; the custom `.rules/` directory
is not assumed to be discovered automatically.

Language-specific sections apply to the relevant language and capability.
Do not introduce tooling or infrastructure merely because a rule describes it.

Coursework follows its applicable course instructions, as routed by the root
AGENTS.md. Project rules do not replace course teaching workflows.

Keep this index synchronized with the rule files.
Detailed requirements belong in their authoritative documents, not this index.
